I'm now thinking about the implications of fullscreen failures on timer behavior. My concern is that the timer won't start if `requestFullscreen` fails, as the current implementation relies on the `isFullscreen` state. Even though the UI requires fullscreen, there could still be a hiccup. I'm considering if the user intends for the timer to start regardless of fullscreen success. I will analyze how to make sure the timer logic is robust. I will also evaluate options for increasing the timer's visibility within the "Top Bar Info" section.


